		orlandowhite/hts-classification-sft-v3


Canonical raw JSONL tool-calling dataset for Unsloth + TRL SFT.



		Format


Each row is stored as raw JSON with:

messages: OpenAI-style conversation messages
tools: list of tool JSON schemas

Assistant tool calls use:
{
  "role": "assistant",
  "tool_calls": [
    {
      "type": "function",
      "function": {
        "name": "lookup_rulings",
        "arguments": {"query": "...", "chapter_filter": "79"}
      }
    }
  ]
}

